type: software
title: "rapidtrees: fast all-pairs phylogenetic tree distances"
abstract: "rapidtrees is a high-performance Rust library, with Python bindings and a command-line interface, for all-pairs phylogenetic tree distances: Robinson-Foulds, weighted Robinson-Foulds and Kuhner-Felsenstein."
